@startuml state_interest
!include _style.iuml
title State Diagram - InterestPayment (Pay Monthly Interest)
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : new InterestPayment(account)\n[account is InterestBearing]

state Pending
state Calculated : entry / amount = balance x monthlyRate
state Skipped : amount = 0.00
state Credited : entry / balance += amount\nTransaction(INTEREST) created
state Recorded : balance and transaction\ncommitted to database
state Failed : failureReason stored

Pending --> Calculated : calculate() [amount > 0]
Pending --> Skipped : calculate() [amount = 0]
Calculated --> Credited : credit()
Credited --> Recorded : markRecorded()\n[applyTransaction committed]
Pending --> Failed : fail(reason)
Calculated --> Failed : fail(reason)
Credited --> Failed : fail(reason)\n[database error -> rollback]

Recorded --> [*]
Skipped --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Calculated
  Savings: rate = 0.0005 (0.05% / month)
  Investment: rate = 0.05 (5% / month)
  Cheque accounts never get an
  InterestPayment (not InterestBearing)
end note
@enduml
